   "text": "The curve $C$ has equation $y = -x^2 + 8x - 5$ and the line $l$ has equation $y = x + 1$.\n\nThe line $l$ meets $C$ at two points. The finite region $R$ is bounded by $C$ and $l$.\n\nShow that the exact area of $R$ is $\\frac{125}{6}$. (5)",
